WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.136 --> 00:00:01.110
(audience cheering)
- Thank you.

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:02.415
What a lovely welcome.

00:00:02.415 --> 00:00:05.670
And to see you here live in the studio.

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:06.810
- I know. I don't know
if you remember this

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:08.370
first time we met, it was
actually on a red carpet.

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:09.203
- I know.

00:00:09.203 --> 00:00:10.036
- It was was very quick.

00:00:10.036 --> 00:00:10.869
- We bumped into each other.
- Yes.

00:00:10.869 --> 00:00:12.240
- We were both in awe of each other.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.530
- And I literally was like,

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.210
is that how we were supposed to come out?

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:16.350
Was I supposed to look like that?

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:17.220
Were we all supposed to look like?

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.500
You looked unbelievably gorgeous.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.333
Anyway, that's

00:00:20.333 --> 00:00:22.110
I just remember you being so kind as well.

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:22.943
- Oh.

00:00:22.943 --> 00:00:23.776
- [Kelly] But I wanna say Merry Christmas.

00:00:23.776 --> 00:00:24.609
We are decorated for Christmas.

00:00:24.609 --> 00:00:25.442
- I'm telling you, I'm with you.

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:26.670
I'm a huge Christmas.
(audience cheering)

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.160
- Me too.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.160
- I love it. I love it. I love it.

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:29.993
- Oh my God.

00:00:29.993 --> 00:00:31.380
Would you ever make
like a Christmas album?

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.340
Have you ever done anything like that?

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:33.840
'Cause you sing so well.
- With you I would.

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:34.673
- Fine.

00:00:34.673 --> 00:00:35.800
- I'd come and sing with
you any day of the week.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:36.802
- Don't offer.

00:00:36.802 --> 00:00:38.310
(audience cheering)

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:40.260
- Well, I just, you such a beautiful voice

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.653
and I was like if you love
Christmas, I love Christmas too.

